      "notes": "# Gofer v3.14.5\n\n## Changes\n\nChanges since v3.14.4:\n- Keep Gofer public latest on the published 3.14.4 release (#437)\n- chore: release v3.14.5 — Complete-evidence Jev review (#436)\n- Handle oversized Jev reviews without losing source context (#434)\n## Assets\n\n- VS Code extension package\n- Claude/Codex/Copilot/Gemini public bundle package\n- Gofer release archive\n\n## Public Release Host\n\nhttps://eai-support.github.io/eai-gofer/releases/\n\n## Public Agent Plugin Install\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://eai-support.github.io/eai-gofer/releases/eai-gofer-agent-plugin-3.14.5.zip \\\n  -o /tmp/eai-gofer-agent-plugin-3.14.5.zip\n\nrm -rf ~/plugins/eai-gofer\nunzip /tmp/eai-gofer-agent-plugin-3.14.5.zip -d ~/plugins\n```\n\nClaude Code:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace add https://github.com/eai-support/eai-gofer --scope user --sparse .claude-plugin --sparse plugins/eai-gofer\nclaude plugin install eai-gofer@eai-gofer --scope user\n```\n\nCodex:\n\n```bash\ncodex plugin marketplace add https://github.com/eai-support/eai-gofer --sparse .agents/plugins --sparse plugins/eai-gofer\ncodex plugin add eai-gofer@eai-gofer\n```\n\nGemini CLI:\n\n```bash\ngemini extensions install https://github.com/eai-support/eai-gofer\n```\n\nCopilot CLI:\n\n```bash\ncopilot plugin marketplace add https://github.com/eai-support/eai-gofer\ncopilot plugin install eai-gofer@eai-gofer\n```\n",
